#: ../../source/docs/modules/sail.rst:3 1108319919a640dc8dd8190219e22b2c
msgid "Sail"
msgstr "帆船"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/sail.rst:9 9f68f77e3d544501ab8048041ae1616f
msgid ""
"This module creates a sailing dashboard window that displays information "
"relevant to sailing vehicles. There are two meters on the left that display "
"apparent and true wind speed and angle. On the right is a panel of "
"instrument displays showing wind speed and angle, speed through water and "
"true heading."
msgstr ""
"该模块创建一个帆船仪表盘窗口，显示与帆船飞行器相关的信息。左侧有两个仪表分别显示视风速度和风角以及真风速度和风角。右侧是仪表显示面板，显示风速和风角、水速及真航向。"

