#: ../../source/docs/modules/sail.rst:28 0fde207f97554522a7ae3f6469c99f86
msgid ""
"Wind angle is relative to the front of the vehicle and is positive in a "
"clockwise direction. True wind speed and angle are calculated from apparent "
"wind speed and angle accounting for the speed through water, however in the "
"absence of a log they are calculated with respect to ground speed."
msgstr "风角相对于飞行器头部，顺时针方向为正。真风速和风角由视风速和风角结合水速计算得出；若无计程仪，则以地速代替计算。"
